  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multimodal models (config_039) achieve the highest accuracy (0.725) using scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder with weighted fusion. However, the impact of aggregation method (transformer vs. None) and fusion strategy (weighted vs. concat) remains uncertain. This experiment tests the same RNA/image encoder pair but with None aggregation and concat fusion, isolating the effect of these design choices. It directly addresses the uncertainty about aggregation/fusion effectiveness while building on the proven success of scvi_n200 and imagenet_vit_l."
}

